{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは早く言いたかったことは\nたくさんのふぁみたんからの\nおめでとう！って言ってもらえて\n凄く嬉しかったです♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯やらせて頂きたいと\n思います( •ㅈ• )うんうん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、あともう一つ\n明日PON!祭りに出演します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー言うの遅いよ(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じよね(´;ω;`)うん\nごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもでもチケット制じゃないから\n明日の予定がない人は\n汐留・日本テレビに\n集まりましょう( •ㅈ• )いぇい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして一緒にわいわい\nしちゃおうじゃないか。おほ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はまいやんちゃんが\n別の件でお休みだから\nあたしはまいやんちゃんポジで\nやらせて頂きます( •ㅈ• )うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからね、ふぁみたんにも\n見にきてもらいたいなー♡\nって凄い思ってるのよ( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほら、きっと来てくれるって\n信じてるよ♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/03/26/0720740/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらこんなにもこの微妙な\nにやけ顏で待ってるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな、にやけてたらね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/03/26/0720740/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間が増えたんだ。\nあたしの足を挟み込む方も\n写真で目つぶってる方も\nいらっしゃいますが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/03/26/0720740/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後はちゃんと決めたぜ。\nめちゃくちゃ笑顔。\nさー明日も笑顔にいきましょう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}